{"id": "40", "title": "而已集", "author": "鲁迅", "category": "文学名著", "count": 31, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/0/40.htm", "intro": "《而已集》是鲁迅1927年所作杂文集，1928年出版。面对反动军阀大肆屠杀革命党人和进步人士，鲁迅先生既愤恨，又无能为力，“这半年我又看见了许多血和许多泪，然而我只有杂感而已。泪揩了，血消了，屠伯们逍遥复逍遥，用钢刀的，用软刀的。而我只有‘杂感’而已。连‘杂感’也被‘放进了应该去的地方’时，我于是只有‘而已’而已。”", "base": "files/article/html/0/40", "chapters": [{"title": "题辞（1）", "file": "2597.html", "available": false}, {"title": "黄花节的杂感", "file": "2598.html", "available": false}, {"title": "略论中国人的脸（1）", "file": "2599.html", "available": false}, {"title": "革命时代的文学（1）", "file": "2600.html", "available": false}, {"title": "写在《劳动问题》之前（1）", "file": "2601.html", "available": false}, {"title": "略谈香港（1）", "file": "2602.html", "available": false}, {"title": "读书杂谈（1）", "file": "2603.html", "available": false}, {"title": "通信（1）", "file": "2604.html", "available": false}, {"title": "答有恒先生（1）", "file": "2605.html", "available": false}, {"title": "辞“大义”（1）", "file": "2606.html", "available": false}, {"title": "反“漫谈”（1）", "file": "2607.html", "available": false}, {"title": "忧“天乳”（1）", "file": "2608.html", "available": false}, {"title": "革“首领”（1）", "file": "2609.html", "available": false}, {"title": "谈“激烈”（1）", "file": "2610.html", "available": false}, {"title": "扣丝杂感（1）", "file": "2611.html", "available": false}, {"title": "“公理”之所在（1）", "file": "2612.html", "available": false}, {"title": "可恶罪（1）", "file": "2613.html", "available": false}, {"title": "意表之外”（1）", "file": "2614.html", "available": false}, {"title": "新时代的放债法（1）", "file": "2615.html", "available": false}, {"title": "魏晋风度及文章与药及酒之关系", "file": "2616.html", "available": false}, {"title": "小杂感（1）", "file": "2617.html", "available": false}, {"title": "再谈香港（1）", "file": "2618.html", "available": false}, {"title": "革命文学（1）", "file": "2619.html", "available": false}, {"title": "《尘影》题辞（1）", "file": "2620.html", "available": false}, {"title": "当陶元庆君的绘画展览时（1）", "file": "2621.html", "available": false}, {"titl